  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "due to EAC now being implemented, i'd like to suggest some features that may make the game more enjoyable.\n1. features from the \"camera animations\" mod. this mod was commonly used by vrchat content creators and allowed us to make more diverse, and theatrical content.\n2. a UI color change option, to explain it simply allows you to change the color of your UI from blue, to any other color. this isnt a need, but simply a cosmetics thing.\n3. player history and instance history. say a person you liked crashed before you could friend them, simply go to player history and add them there! as for instance history, if you crash you can go to instance history and re-join the same instance.\n4. text to speech. as a person who struggles with selective mutism, please add a tts feature. struggling with pens only for people to not be able to read your handwriting makes communication very difficult.\n5. join notifier. so you can see if a friend joins the world.\n6. portal confirm. a feature that makes it so when you pass through a portal, you get asked if you'd actually like to go through that portla.\n7. audio to text for deaf players. you could toggle this on and off, as well as for certain players, kind of like how you can mute people in game or depending on their rank.\n8. pre-load worlds. an option to pre-load a world before entering.\n9. the ability to search avatars. we have been asking for this for such a long time and it has not been implemented.\n10. avatar categories. you can simply categorize your avatars.\n11. an avatar scale, so you can make avatars smaller or bigger. this is a feature already implemented in some avatars as well.\nthis is all and i hope you take these features into consideration. please upvote if you agree. \nsincerely, peachybat.",
